; lost this tx (can't get it in a CSV from broker A)
; The 100 EUR deposit was converted to USDC on broker A (originally USDT, later
; converted to USDC due to EU regulations but going straight to USDC for
; simplicity)
; Trade spent 105.568 USDC, remaining balance is 2.812 USDC
; Total USDC received 105.568 + 2.812 = 108.38 USDC
; We use @@ to specify total EUR cost and let hledger calculate the unit rate
2024-04-03 EUR to USDC conversion on broker A
    assets:broker-a:USDC      108.38 USDC @@ 100.00 EUR
    assets:broker-a:especes  -100.00 EUR

